00:29:02,960 --> 00:29:08,720
And then we also have a design mantra which I stole from my brother and his company, which is the best idea with.

361
00:29:09,600 --> 00:29:18,960
And that just means, like, no matter what department you worked in, no matter what your job is, if you have the best idea about anything company wide, it wins.

362
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:26,320
So we really encourage everyone on the team to share ideas about every aspect of the business.

363
00:29:26,640 --> 00:29:30,640
And we don't find that it becomes too many cooks in the kitchen because we're still really small.

364
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:34,080
And everyone respects each other's area of expertise, of course.

