So, because Pakbak has no language, it's very versatile and accessible to people all over the world, and it is available globally.

388
00:31:30,160 --> 00:31:38,640
The US is our biggest market at the moment, but we have a lot of users outside of the sort of the western world and also English-speaking countries.

