00:38:25,280 --> 00:38:30,720
Like, for lack of a better word, there's a lot of apps out there that have that and it's, it's what it is.

451
00:38:31,040 --> 00:38:35,280
But for me and for our team, it was just never, it was never even a discussion.

452
00:38:35,360 --> 00:38:38,880
It was like the sketch, like nothing sketchy can happen in pop pop.

